<!--
  Godwall copy.

  House rule, and it is the reason several of these read longer than a normal label: this app
  makes security claims, so every string states the REACH of what it controls. "Block app" is
  short and wrong — Godwall denies name lookups, and an app denied at DNS can still reach a
  hardcoded IP. A user who trusts a control further than it goes is worse off than one who was
  told the boundary.
-->
